        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Sauli akamwambia mtumishi wake, Lakini angalia, kama tukienda, tumpelekee mtu huyo kitu gani? Maana chakula kimekwisha vyomboni mwetu, wala hapana zawadi ya kumpelekea mtu wa Mungu; tuna nini sisi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
